# {{name}}

A desktop and browser app built from the same Rust source with
[Kael](https://github.com/Augani/kael).

The project pins the Rust toolchain used by its matching Kael release.
On macOS, the starter compiles Metal shaders at launch so development works
with either Command Line Tools or full Xcode. For release builds with full
Xcode, remove `runtime_shaders` from the `kael` dependency to precompile them.

## Run

```bash
cargo run
```

## Run in a browser

Install the matching WebAssembly packager once, then build and open a local
server through the Kael CLI:

```bash
cargo install wasm-bindgen-cli --version 0.2.122 --locked
npm install --global binaryen@132.0.0
kael web serve
```

`kael web build` writes deployable static files to `dist/web`.

## Release build

```bash
cargo build --release
```
